    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d60">

                <pb facs="0172" n="68" sameAs="frus:frus1913/pg68"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 033.3211/9.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The American Ambassador to the Secretary of State.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram—Extract.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">American Embassy</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Rio de Janeiro</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1913-05-16">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">May 16, 1913</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>The Minister for Foreign Affairs, will sail May 17 on the dreadnaught <hi
                        rendition="#italic">Minos Geraes</hi>, will arrive between June 7 and 10,
                    and will remain about three weeks in the United States.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Morgan</hi>.</signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
